{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 31, :comments ["<b>For it is stronger than us</b> — It is stated in the Gemara: do not read ממנו but rather ממנו — for even in the World to Come He cannot remove His vessels from there. Some interpret: ממנו — meaning מנא, i.e., vessel. And some interpret: since all the letters of ממנו are doubled, like mem, nun, vav — therefore it includes two matters: its plain sense and its derash."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:22:06.430569485Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}